{"tool_name":"lavaa","contents":["oeb","bioschemas","biotools"],"fetched_metadata":{"biotools":{"id":"lavaa","home":"https://geneviz.aalto.fi/LAVAA/","summary":"Lightweight Association Viewer Across Ailments.","addition_date":"2023-08-24T13:50:29.076067Z","last_update_date":"2024-11-24T14:42:57.005448Z","tool_type":["Web application"],"accessibility":"Open access","biotools_curie":"biotools:lavaa","cost":"Free of charge","credit":[{"email":"eric.fauman@pfizer.com","name":"Eric B Fauman","orcidid":"https://orcid.org/0000-0002-9739-0249","typeEntity":"Person"}],"documentation":[{"type":["General"],"url":"https://geneviz.aalto.fi/LAVAA/documentation.html"}],"edit_permission":{"type":"private"},"function":[{"operation":[{"term":"Collapsing methods","uri":"http://edamontology.org/operation_3791"},{"term":"Visualisation","uri":"http://edamontology.org/operation_0337"}]}],"name":"LAVAA","operating_system":["Linux","Mac","Windows"],"owner":"Pub2Tools","publication":[{"doi":"10.1093/bioadv/vbad018","metadata":{"abstract":"Motivation: Biobank scale genetic associations results over thousands of traits can be difficult to visualize and navigate. Results: We have created LAVAA, a visualization web-application to generate genetic volcano plots for simultaneously considering the P-value, effect size, case counts, trait class and fine-mapping posterior probability at a singlenucleotide polymorphism (SNP) across a range of traits from a large set of genome-wide association study. We find that user interaction with association results in LAVAA can enrich and enhance the biological interpretation of individual loci. Availability and implementation: LAVAA is available as a stand-alone web service (https://geneviz.aalto.fi/LAVAA/) and will be available in future releases of the finngen.fi website starting with release 10 in late 2023.","authors":[{"name":"Cerioli N."},{"name":"Daly M."},{"name":"Fauman E.B."},{"name":"Keppo S."},{"name":"Kurki M."},{"name":"Reeve M.P."},{"name":"Vyas R